        "heading": "How large are QTC Medical Services' FY2026 federal obligations?",
        "body": "QTC Medical Services obligated $2.3B in FY2026 to date. QTC Medical Services won 41 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $55.1M. QTC Medical Services' obligations are down 21.7% year over year. Fiscal-year history shows FY25 $2.9B and FY24 $1.9B."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the main federal buyers for QTC Medical Services?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $2.2B to QTC Medical Services in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense obligated $29.2M and the Department of Homeland Security obligated $2M. The Department of Justice obligated $1.1M and the Department of the Interior obligated $284K."
      }
