      "q": "How much does QTC Medical Services make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "QTC Medical Services obligated $2.3B in FY2026 to date. QTC Medical Services won 41 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $55.1M, and obligations are down 21.7% year over year. Historical obligations were FY25 $2.9B, FY24 $1.9B, FY23 $1.2B, FY22 $935M, and FY21 $1B."
